<title>JAPAN: Japan July service price index down 0.9% yr/yr-BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan July service price index down 0.9% yr/yr-BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) in July fell 0.9 percent from a year earlier, but was unchanged from a month earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The overall index stood at 102.1 for July, the same as the previous month.</p>
<p>The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.  </p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year (Y-Y) and month-on-month (M-M):</p>
<p>			JULY Y-Y    M-M     JUNE  Y-Y   M-M</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance	0.0  0.0	     0.0  0.0</p>
<p> Real estate	     -2.4 +0.1	    -2.4 -0.1</p>
<p> Transport		 +0.7 +0.2	    +1.0 +0.1</p>
<p> Information services  -0.1  0.0	    -0.3  0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -2.3  0.0	    -2.3  0.0</p>
<p> Advertising services  +0.7 -1.1	    +1.3 +0.8</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -5.4 -0.3	    -5.8 -0.9</p>
<p> Other services	  -0.3  0.0	    -0.2 -0.1</p>
</text>
